internal/oracle/testdata/constraint_relation_sites/r2_readonly_direct.a:4:7: Adamic 0.1 refuses a value of type Holder seen as { n: number; }, whose readonly field n becomes writable: a readonly field may hold something narrower than number, which a write of number would replace; keep n readonly in the type it's seen as, or copy the value ({ ...value }) (adamic/invariant-mutable)
